      <note>- invoice_id (dari fact_invoice)
- sk_invoicedate -> join ke dim_date: year, month_number, month_name
- mengurutkan year, month_number, month_name secara ascending
- menjumlah (sum) jumlah terjual dan revenue
- year
- month_number
- month_name
- revenue
- jumlah_terjual</note>
